# Plain Help Center groups

When creating or updating customer articles in Plain (`help.cashsouk.com`, `hc_01M1KAJMZ5MYD7WEJQRBG779FZ`), set `helpCenterArticleGroupId`. Do not leave articles ungrouped.

Use these groups only:

- **Getting Started** (`hcag_01M1NDKM9177X4CG0HKF88N3ZX`) — shared by issuers and investors
- **For Issuers** (`hcag_01M1KCAJ0A844SZN8K9C3M4X88`) — issuer-only flows
- **For Investors** (`hcag_01M1KCAJA4EQ495A1P0SNNQSZ6`) — investor-only flows

If an article does not fit any of the three, propose a new group and **wait for confirmation** before creating it. An article can belong to only one group.
